          <div style="width:44px; height:44px; background: var(--teal); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0; font-weight:800; color:var(--navy);">W</div>
          <div><p style="font-weight:700; color:var(--navy); margin-bottom: 4px;">Waseem Shahzad</p><p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-mid);">Named sources: First Page Sage (marketing ROI by channel) and Litmus (2018 email ROI press release). <a href="/about/" style="color: var(--teal-dark);">About →</a></p></div>
        </div>
      </article>
